cture, planning, and interior design firm, lead by Chad Oppenheim. The firm\u2019s work is built on both a physical and spiritual contextual sensitivity, supported by evocative and economic design solutions that all serve to enhance life.", "short_description": "Parti is a series of Virtual Reality podcasts exploring architecture."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.dboxvr.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.dboxvr.com/legal", "publisher_name": "DBOXVR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.dboxvr.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "EXPERIENCE_360_NON_GAME", "EXPLORATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": [], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "227752729564788"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162682_323109744827473_8060706870655975424_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nSS9GCh8Hf0Q7kNvwGRpwRT&_nc_oc=AdkoFvmcyLu2rdDmS8rPUpXXo_ErGC8RUShqtdWa0gLVPCx7udVkd_aYl5VMp1oG_f0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxyKIAqQC1dim1Y4PGnMCG6eWhYjpg5ZXN8YlNeAIxOTg&oe=69B41F0D"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Parti 2: 252 Bal Bay Drive", "platform": "ANDROID", "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "release_date": 1512669900, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "1641054832624587", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {